    {
      "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-2-sec-11",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "11 Subsection 15Y(2)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2018c00199#sch-2-sec-11"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2018c00199.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2018c00199.pdf, p.10",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\nProceedings involving adult complainants\n\n(2) This Part contains special rules for adult complainants involved in\nproceedings to which this subsection applies. This subsection\napplies to proceedings for any of the following offences:\n\n(a) an offence against Division 270 of the Criminal Code\n(slavery and slavery-like conditions);\n\n(b) an offence against Division 271 of the Criminal Code\n(trafficking in persons and debt bondage);\n\n(c) an offence that includes the commission of, or the intention\nto commit, an offence of a kind referred to in paragraph (a) or\n(b);\n\n(d) an offence of:\n\n(i) attempting to commit; or\n\n(ii) conspiring to commit; or\n\n(iii) inciting the commission of;\n\nan offence of a kind referred to in paragraph (a), (b) or (c).\nProceedings involving special witnesses\n\n(3) This Part contains special rules that can apply for special witnesses\ninvolved in proceedings for any Commonwealth offence.\n\nSupporting victims and witnesses in criminal proceedings  Schedule 2\nVulnerable witness protections  Part 1\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Law Enforcement Integrity, Vulnerable Witness\nProtection and Other Measures) Act 2013\nCompilation date: 23/5/18\nRegistered: 30/5/18\n\nRelated proceedings included\n\n(4) Each of subsections (1), (2) and (3) also applies to any proceedings\nconnected with a proceeding referred to in that subsection.\nExample: Committal proceedings.\n\n(5) Similarly, subsection 15YAB(1) (about special witnesses) also\napplies to any proceedings connected with a proceeding for a\nCommonwealth offence.",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\nProceedings involving adult complainants\n\n(2) This Part contains special rules for adult complainants involved in\nproceedings to which this subsection applies. This subsection\napplies to proceedings for any of the following offences:\n\n(a) an offence against Division 270 of the Criminal Code\n(slavery and slavery-like conditions);\n\n(b) an offence against Division 271 of the Criminal Code\n(trafficking in persons and debt bondage);\n\n(c) an offence that includes the commission of, or the intention\nto commit, an offence of a kind referred to in paragraph (a) or\n(b);\n\n(d) an offence of:\n\n(i) attempting to commit; or\n\n(ii) conspiring to commit; or\n\n(iii) inciting the commission of;\n\nan offence of a kind referred to in paragraph (a), (b) or (c).\nProceedings involving special witnesses\n\n(3) This Part contains special rules that can apply for special witnesses\ninvolved in proceedings for any Commonwealth offence.\n\nSupporting victims and witnesses in criminal proceedings  Schedule 2\nVulnerable witness protections  Part 1\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Law Enforcement Integrity, Vulnerable Witness\nProtection and Other Measures) Act 2013\nCompilation date: 23/5/18\nRegistered: 30/5/18\n\nRelated proceedings included\n\n(4) Each of subsections (1), (2) and (3) also applies to any proceedings\nconnected with a proceeding referred to in that subsection.\nExample: Committal proceedings.\n\n(5) Similarly, subsection 15YAB(1) (about special witnesses) also\napplies to any proceedings connected with a proceeding for a\nCommonwealth offence.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-2-sec-11-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-2-sec-11-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-2-sec-11-ss-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-2-sec-11-ss-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3beea54d952918fc77570b97181dd141fb73a5503e46f6f90760428d186a08f3"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2018c00199#sch-2-sec-11",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "11 Subsection 15Y(2)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 10,
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\nProceedings involving adult complainants\n\n(2) This Part contains special rules for adult complainants involved in\nproceedings to which this subsection applies. This subsection\napplies to proceedings for any of the following offences:\n\n(a) an offence against Division 270 of the Criminal Code\n(slavery and slavery-like conditions);\n\n(b) an offence against Division 271 of the Criminal Code\n(trafficking in persons and debt bondage);\n\n(c) an offence that includes the commission of, or the intention\nto commit, an offence of a kind referred to in paragraph (a) or\n(b);\n\n(d) an offence of:\n\n(i) attempting to commit; or\n\n(ii) conspiring to commit; or\n\n(iii) inciting the commission of;\n\nan offence of a kind referred to in paragraph (a), (b) or (c).\nProceedings involving special witnesses\n\n(3) This Part contains special rules that can apply for special witnesses\ninvolved in proceedings for any Commonwealth offence.\n\nSupporting victims and witnesses in criminal proceedings  Schedule 2\nVulnerable witness protections  Part 1\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Law Enforcement Integrity, Vulnerable Witness\nProtection and Other Measures) Act 2013\nCompilation date: 23/5/18\nRegistered: 30/5/18\n\nRelated proceedings included\n\n(4) Each of subsections (1), (2) and (3) also applies to any proceedings\nconnected with a proceeding referred to in that subsection.\nExample: Committal proceedings.\n\n(5) Similarly, subsection 15YAB(1) (about special witnesses) also\napplies to any proceedings connected with a proceeding for a\nCommonwealth offence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-2-sec-11-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "11(2) Subsection 15Y(2)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2018c00199#sch-2-sec-11-ss-2"
