      "dc:source": "c2018c00199.pdf, p.11",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the definition, substitute:\nproceeding means a proceeding to which one or more of\nsubsections 15Y(1), (2) and (3) apply.\n\nSchedule 2  Supporting victims and witnesses in criminal proceedings",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the definition, substitute:\nproceeding means a proceeding to which one or more of\nsubsections 15Y(1), (2) and (3) apply.\n\nSchedule 2  Supporting victims and witnesses in criminal proceedings",
