      "dc:source": "c2018c00199.pdf, p.12",
      "values:originalText": "(3) A vulnerable adult complainant need not be involved in the\nvulnerable adult proceeding or the initiation of that proceeding.\n15YAB  Special witnesses\nMeaning of special witness",
      "skos:definition": "(3) A vulnerable adult complainant need not be involved in the\nvulnerable adult proceeding or the initiation of that proceeding.\n15YAB  Special witnesses\nMeaning of special witness",
