      "values:originalText": "(2) A declaration under subsection (1) may be made on the court’s\nown initiative or on application by or on behalf of a party to the\nproceeding.\nOrders that certain protections apply to a special witness",
      "skos:definition": "(2) A declaration under subsection (1) may be made on the court’s\nown initiative or on application by or on behalf of a party to the\nproceeding.\nOrders that certain protections apply to a special witness",
      "values:partOf": {
