      "skos:note": "A declaration under subsection (1) may be made on the court’s own initiative or on application by or on behalf of a party to the proceeding. Adult can opt out of being treated as vulnerable adult complainant."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2018c00199#sch-2-sec-19-ss-2",
