    {
      "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-2-sec-19-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "19(3) After section 15YA",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2018c00199#sch-2-sec-19-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2018c00199.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2018c00199.pdf, p.12",
      "values:originalText": "(3) In a special witness proceeding, the court may order that one or\nmore of the following sections apply to a special witness:\n\n(a) section 15YG (about unrepresented defendants);\n\n(b) section 15YH (about represented defendants);\n\n(c) section 15YI (about closed-circuit television);\n\n(d) section 15YL (about alternative arrangements);\n\n(e) section 15YM (about use of video recordings);\n\n(f) section 15YO (about accompanying adults);\n\n(g) section 15YP (about excluding people from the courtroom).",
      "skos:definition": "(3) In a special witness proceeding, the court may order that one or\nmore of the following sections apply to a special witness:\n\n(a) section 15YG (about unrepresented defendants);\n\n(b) section 15YH (about represented defendants);\n\n(c) section 15YI (about closed-circuit television);\n\n(d) section 15YL (about alternative arrangements);\n\n(e) section 15YM (about use of video recordings);\n\n(f) section 15YO (about accompanying adults);\n\n(g) section 15YP (about excluding people from the courtroom).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-2-sec-19"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-2-sec-19-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-2-sec-19-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-2-sec-19-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-2-sec-19-ss-3-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-2-sec-19-ss-3-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-2-sec-19-ss-3-logic-cogai-5"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-2-sec-19-ss-3-logic-deontic-6"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3262691ba36a87c0a23010bcbfcd525f2a14f54fab1f4ec2c54e6a253bb58dff",
      "skos:note": "Vulnerable adult complainant need not be involved in the vulnerable adult proceeding. Court may order application of certain sections to a special witness"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2018c00199#sch-2-sec-19-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "19(3) After section 15YA",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 12,
      "values:originalText": "(3) In a special witness proceeding, the court may order that one or\nmore of the following sections apply to a special witness:\n\n(a) section 15YG (about unrepresented defendants);\n\n(b) section 15YH (about represented defendants);\n\n(c) section 15YI (about closed-circuit television);\n\n(d) section 15YL (about alternative arrangements);\n\n(e) section 15YM (about use of video recordings);\n\n(f) section 15YO (about accompanying adults);\n\n(g) section 15YP (about excluding people from the courtroom)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-2-sec-19-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
