      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2018c00199#sch-2-sec-23",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "23 At the end of section 15YE",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 14,
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\n(3) This subsection applies to the following persons:\n\n(a) for a child proceeding—a child witness;\n\n(b) for a vulnerable adult proceeding—a vulnerable adult\ncomplainant;\n\n(c) for a special witness proceeding—a special witness."
