      "dc:source": "c2018c00199.pdf, p.14",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(1A) This subsection applies to the following persons:\n\n(a) for a child proceeding—a child witness (other than a child\ncomplainant);\n\n(b) for a vulnerable adult proceeding—a vulnerable adult\ncomplainant;\n\n(c) for a special witness proceeding—a special witness for whom\nan order under subsection 15YAB(3) is in force for this\nsection.",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n\n(1A) This subsection applies to the following persons:\n\n(a) for a child proceeding—a child witness (other than a child\ncomplainant);\n\n(b) for a vulnerable adult proceeding—a vulnerable adult\ncomplainant;\n\n(c) for a special witness proceeding—a special witness for whom\nan order under subsection 15YAB(3) is in force for this\nsection.",
