          "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-2-sec-279-3-ss-1-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-2-sec-279-3-ss-1-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5aa4dd8a37e3591421993520d6558aceb66bb5a6be459ce01e336b1d6e07124f",
      "skos:note": "Witness must give evidence under direction in specific conditions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2018c00199#sch-2-sec-279-3-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "279(1) 3  Technical requirements for video link",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 26,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A witness can give evidence under a direction only if:\n\n(a) the courtroom or other place in Australia where the court is\nsitting (the Australian location); and\n\n(b) the place where the evidence is given (the overseas location);\nare equipped with video facilities that:\n\n(c) enable appropriate persons at the Australian location to see\nand hear the witness give the evidence; and\n\n(d) enable appropriate persons at the overseas location to see and\nhear appropriate persons at the Australian location."
    },
