    {
      "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-2-sec-16ab-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "16AB(6) Matters relating to victim impact statements",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2018c00199#sch-2-sec-16ab-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2018c00199.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2018c00199.pdf, p.30",
      "values:originalText": "(6) The person convicted of the offence may only test the facts in a\nvictim impact statement:\n\n(a) by way of cross-examining the maker of the statement; and\n\n(b) if the court gives leave to do so.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) The person convicted of the offence may only test the facts in a\nvictim impact statement:\n\n(a) by way of cross-examining the maker of the statement; and\n\n(b) if the court gives leave to do so.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-2-sec-16ab"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-2-sec-16ab-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-2-sec-16ab-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ff39f66e7f0d9933903f5aeba0901d7d96898ebb7ef9f997cabe4a90eca95f7d",
      "skos:note": "Person convicted of offence may only test facts in victim impact statement."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2018c00199#sch-2-sec-16ab-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "16AB(6) Matters relating to victim impact statements",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 30,
      "values:originalText": "(6) The person convicted of the offence may only test the facts in a\nvictim impact statement:\n\n(a) by way of cross-examining the maker of the statement; and\n\n(b) if the court gives leave to do so."
    },
    {
