    {
      "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-2-sec-93",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "93 Application of amendments",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2018c00199#sch-2-sec-93"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2018c00199.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2018c00199.pdf, p.31",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe amendments made by this Schedule apply in relation to offences\ncommitted (or alleged to have been committed) on or after the day this\nSchedule commences.\n(2)\nThe amendments made by Part 1 of this Schedule also apply in relation\nto proceedings instituted after the commencement of Schedule 5 to the\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018 (whether the proceedings are for offences\ncommitted, or alleged to have been committed, before or after the\ncommencement of this Schedule).\n\nSchedule 3  Deterring people smuggling",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThe amendments made by this Schedule apply in relation to offences\ncommitted (or alleged to have been committed) on or after the day this\nSchedule commences.\n(2)\nThe amendments made by Part 1 of this Schedule also apply in relation\nto proceedings instituted after the commencement of Schedule 5 to the\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018 (whether the proceedings are for offences\ncommitted, or alleged to have been committed, before or after the\ncommencement of this Schedule).\n\nSchedule 3  Deterring people smuggling",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-2-sec-93-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0580a23e4b28315a50172c29f2c84d0e87637e5ce839f1b797e9950c95e0f9bb",
      "skos:note": "Amendments apply in relation to offences committed on or after the commencement of this Schedule."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2018c00199#sch-2-sec-93",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "93 Application of amendments",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 31,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe amendments made by this Schedule apply in relation to offences\ncommitted (or alleged to have been committed) on or after the day this\nSchedule commences.\n(2)\nThe amendments made by Part 1 of this Schedule also apply in relation\nto proceedings instituted after the commencement of Schedule 5 to the\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018 (whether the proceedings are for offences\ncommitted, or alleged to have been committed, before or after the\ncommencement of this Schedule).\n\nSchedule 3  Deterring people smuggling"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-2-sec-93-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-2-sec-93"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
