      "dc:source": "c2018c00199.pdf, p.32",
      "values:originalText": "information)\nOmit “a photograph (including an X-ray photograph) or any other\nrecord or information”, substitute “a record, or information,”.",
      "skos:definition": "information)\nOmit “a photograph (including an X-ray photograph) or any other\nrecord or information”, substitute “a record, or information,”.",
