      "skos:definition": "(2) The court must take into account any period that the person has\nspent in immigration detention during the period:\n\n(a) starting when the offence was committed; and\n\n(b) ending when the person is sentenced for the offence.\nNote:\nThis enables the court to take into account time spent while not in\npunitive detention.",
      "values:partOf": {
