      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-3-sec-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "7 Paragraphs 236E(3)(a) to (i)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2018c00199#sch-3-sec-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2018c00199.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2018c00199.pdf, p.37",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the paragraphs, substitute:\n\n(a) the location of the target vessel or aircraft during the exercise\nof those maritime powers;\n\n(b) the location, during the exercise of those maritime powers, of\na Commonwealth ship or Commonwealth aircraft from which\nthe exercise of those maritime powers was directed or\ncoordinated;\n\n(c) the contents of any list of passengers on board the target\nvessel or aircraft, or passenger cards relating to passengers on\nboard the target vessel or aircraft;\n\n(d) the number of passengers on board the target vessel or\naircraft;\n\n(e) the number of crew on board the target vessel or aircraft;\n\n(f) details about anything a maritime officer did under\nsubsection 64(1), or section 66, of the Maritime Powers Act\n\nSchedule 3  Deterring people smuggling",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the paragraphs, substitute:\n\n(a) the location of the target vessel or aircraft during the exercise\nof those maritime powers;\n\n(b) the location, during the exercise of those maritime powers, of\na Commonwealth ship or Commonwealth aircraft from which\nthe exercise of those maritime powers was directed or\ncoordinated;\n\n(c) the contents of any list of passengers on board the target\nvessel or aircraft, or passenger cards relating to passengers on\nboard the target vessel or aircraft;\n\n(d) the number of passengers on board the target vessel or\naircraft;\n\n(e) the number of crew on board the target vessel or aircraft;\n\n(f) details about anything a maritime officer did under\nsubsection 64(1), or section 66, of the Maritime Powers Act\n\nSchedule 3  Deterring people smuggling",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-3-sec-7-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-3-sec-7-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4e65d41f589339f8f0ce4825626d7d651feab12bc6b578ca923152c2562f9cf1",
      "skos:note": "Repeal certain paragraphs and substitute with new provisions regarding maritime powers."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2018c00199#sch-3-sec-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7 Paragraphs 236E(3)(a) to (i)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 37,
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the paragraphs, substitute:\n\n(a) the location of the target vessel or aircraft during the exercise\nof those maritime powers;\n\n(b) the location, during the exercise of those maritime powers, of\na Commonwealth ship or Commonwealth aircraft from which\nthe exercise of those maritime powers was directed or\ncoordinated;\n\n(c) the contents of any list of passengers on board the target\nvessel or aircraft, or passenger cards relating to passengers on\nboard the target vessel or aircraft;\n\n(d) the number of passengers on board the target vessel or\naircraft;\n\n(e) the number of crew on board the target vessel or aircraft;\n\n(f) details about anything a maritime officer did under\nsubsection 64(1), or section 66, of the Maritime Powers Act\n\nSchedule 3  Deterring people smuggling"
    },
    {
