      "dc:source": "c2018c00199.pdf, p.47",
      "values:originalText": "An application may be made to the Administrative Appeals\nTribunal for review of:\n\n(a) a decision of the AUSTRAC CEO under subsection 233E(2);\nor\n\n(b) a reviewable decision made by the AUSTRAC CEO\npersonally.",
      "skos:definition": "An application may be made to the Administrative Appeals\nTribunal for review of:\n\n(a) a decision of the AUSTRAC CEO under subsection 233E(2);\nor\n\n(b) a reviewable decision made by the AUSTRAC CEO\npersonally.",
      "cml:asserts": [
