      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 51,
      "values:originalText": "(ii) annexed to the United Nations Secretary-General’s\nreport S/25704 (1993) given pursuant to paragraph 2 of\nUnited Nations Security Council Resolution 808\nS/RES/808 (1993); and\n\n(b) for the Rwanda Tribunal—the Statute of the Tribunal\nannexed to (and adopted by) United Nations Security Council\nResolution 955 S/RES/955 (1994); and\n\n(c) for the International Residual Mechanism for Criminal\nTribunals—the Statute of the Mechanism in Annex 1 to (and\nadopted by) United Nations Security Council Resolution"
    },
