      "cof:title": "13 At the end of subsection 42(3)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 54,
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\n; or (c) in the case of the International Residual Mechanism for\nCriminal Tribunals—Article 13 of the Statute of the Tribunal."
    },
