    {
      "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-5-sec-15",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15 Application of amendments",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2018c00199#sch-5-sec-15"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2018c00199.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2018c00199.pdf, p.54",
      "values:originalText": "All of the following:\n\n(a) the amendments made by items 2, 5, 6, 8 and 11 to 13 of this\nSchedule;\n\nAssisting the International Residual Mechanism for Criminal Tribunals  Schedule 5\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Law Enforcement Integrity, Vulnerable Witness\nProtection and Other Measures) Act 2013\nCompilation date: 23/5/18\nRegistered: 30/5/18\n\n(b) paragraph (c) of the definition of Statute of the Tribunal in\nsubsection 4(1) of the International Transfer of Prisoners Act\n1997 (as inserted by this Schedule);\n\n(c) paragraph (c) of the definition of Statute of the Tribunal in\nsection 4 of the International War Crimes Tribunals Act 1995\n(as inserted by this Schedule);\napply on or after the day this Schedule commences in relation to\nrequests, or orders, made by the International Residual Mechanism for\nCriminal Tribunals before, on or after that day.\n\nSchedule 6  Miscellaneous amendments\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Law Enforcement Integrity, Vulnerable Witness\nProtection and Other Measures) Act 2013\n\nCompilation date: 23/5/18\nRegistered: 30/5/18",
      "skos:definition": "All of the following:\n\n(a) the amendments made by items 2, 5, 6, 8 and 11 to 13 of this\nSchedule;\n\nAssisting the International Residual Mechanism for Criminal Tribunals  Schedule 5\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Law Enforcement Integrity, Vulnerable Witness\nProtection and Other Measures) Act 2013\nCompilation date: 23/5/18\nRegistered: 30/5/18\n\n(b) paragraph (c) of the definition of Statute of the Tribunal in\nsubsection 4(1) of the International Transfer of Prisoners Act\n1997 (as inserted by this Schedule);\n\n(c) paragraph (c) of the definition of Statute of the Tribunal in\nsection 4 of the International War Crimes Tribunals Act 1995\n(as inserted by this Schedule);\napply on or after the day this Schedule commences in relation to\nrequests, or orders, made by the International Residual Mechanism for\nCriminal Tribunals before, on or after that day.\n\nSchedule 6  Miscellaneous amendments\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Law Enforcement Integrity, Vulnerable Witness\nProtection and Other Measures) Act 2013\n\nCompilation date: 23/5/18\nRegistered: 30/5/18",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-5-sec-15-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-5-sec-15-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "049e15577f94c244c70fbbae061cc888561577238686d066ce483df9fe971cf0",
      "skos:note": "Applicable amendments and definitions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2018c00199#sch-5-sec-15",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15 Application of amendments",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 54,
      "values:originalText": "All of the following:\n\n(a) the amendments made by items 2, 5, 6, 8 and 11 to 13 of this\nSchedule;\n\nAssisting the International Residual Mechanism for Criminal Tribunals  Schedule 5\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Law Enforcement Integrity, Vulnerable Witness\nProtection and Other Measures) Act 2013\nCompilation date: 23/5/18\nRegistered: 30/5/18\n\n(b) paragraph (c) of the definition of Statute of the Tribunal in\nsubsection 4(1) of the International Transfer of Prisoners Act\n1997 (as inserted by this Schedule);\n\n(c) paragraph (c) of the definition of Statute of the Tribunal in\nsection 4 of the International War Crimes Tribunals Act 1995\n(as inserted by this Schedule);\napply on or after the day this Schedule commences in relation to\nrequests, or orders, made by the International Residual Mechanism for\nCriminal Tribunals before, on or after that day.\n\nSchedule 6  Miscellaneous amendments\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Law Enforcement Integrity, Vulnerable Witness\nProtection and Other Measures) Act 2013\n\nCompilation date: 23/5/18\nRegistered: 30/5/18"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-5-sec-15-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-5-sec-15"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
