      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "apply",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Application of amendments",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-6-sec-1-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "1 Subsection 8(1C)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2018c00199#sch-6-sec-1-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2018c00199.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2018c00199.pdf, p.56",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n\n(1C) The Minister and the following person:\n\n(a) for Norfolk Island—the Administrator of Norfolk Island;\n\n(b) for any other external Territory:\n\n(i) the Minister administering the Department that deals\nwith the administration of the Territory; or\n\n(ii) the Territory’s Administrator (if any);\nmay enter into arrangements for the provision of police services\nand regulatory services for that Territory.\n\n(1D) The provision of police services and regulatory services in an\nexternal Territory must be in accordance with any arrangements in\nforce under subsection (1C) for the Territory.",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n\n(1C) The Minister and the following person:\n\n(a) for Norfolk Island—the Administrator of Norfolk Island;\n\n(b) for any other external Territory:\n\n(i) the Minister administering the Department that deals\nwith the administration of the Territory; or\n\n(ii) the Territory’s Administrator (if any);\nmay enter into arrangements for the provision of police services\nand regulatory services for that Territory.\n\n(1D) The provision of police services and regulatory services in an\nexternal Territory must be in accordance with any arrangements in\nforce under subsection (1C) for the Territory.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-6-sec-1-3-ss-1c"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-6-sec-1-3-ss-1d"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "fc61fc4a50e655d12b70c909f99174b3a8932dca19bfcf9d8128e3cad72db45b"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2018c00199#sch-6-sec-1-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1 Subsection 8(1C)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 56,
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n\n(1C) The Minister and the following person:\n\n(a) for Norfolk Island—the Administrator of Norfolk Island;\n\n(b) for any other external Territory:\n\n(i) the Minister administering the Department that deals\nwith the administration of the Territory; or\n\n(ii) the Territory’s Administrator (if any);\nmay enter into arrangements for the provision of police services\nand regulatory services for that Territory.\n\n(1D) The provision of police services and regulatory services in an\nexternal Territory must be in accordance with any arrangements in\nforce under subsection (1C) for the Territory."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-6-sec-1-3-ss-1c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "1(1C) Subsection 8(1C)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2018c00199#sch-6-sec-1-3-ss-1c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2018c00199.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2018c00199.pdf, p.56",
      "values:originalText": "(1C) The Minister and the following person:\n\n(a) for Norfolk Island—the Administrator of Norfolk Island;\n\n(b) for any other external Territory:\n\n(i) the Minister administering the Department that deals\nwith the administration of the Territory; or\n\n(ii) the Territory’s Administrator (if any);\nmay enter into arrangements for the provision of police services\nand regulatory services for that Territory.",
      "skos:definition": "(1C) The Minister and the following person:\n\n(a) for Norfolk Island—the Administrator of Norfolk Island;\n\n(b) for any other external Territory:\n\n(i) the Minister administering the Department that deals\nwith the administration of the Territory; or\n\n(ii) the Territory’s Administrator (if any);\nmay enter into arrangements for the provision of police services\nand regulatory services for that Territory.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2018c00199-sch-6-sec-1-3"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
