        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The Commissioner has delegated one or more powers, functions or duties under subsection (3) and the AFP employee is acting in or performing the duties of the senior executive AFP employee.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The Commissioner is taken to have delegated the powers, functions or duties mentioned in paragraph (a) to the AFP employee mentioned in paragraph (b)."
    },
